<section class="lawfarm-cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box-lawfarm">
      <div class="cta-inner-content">
        <div class="section-tag">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          ANÁLISE DE VIABILIDADE
        </div>

        <h2 class="cta-lawfarm-title">
          Não Entregue Sua CNH Sem Antes <span class="text-bronze">Verificar a Legalidade</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="cta-lawfarm-desc">
          Fale diretamente com a equipe da Dra. Marcela Santana no WhatsApp e solicite uma avaliação dos vícios e prazos do seu processo no DETRAN.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-btn-wrapper">
          <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=5534991692737&text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20Dra.%20Marcela!%20Gostaria%20de%20uma%20an%C3%A1lise%20jur%C3%ADdica%20do%20meu%20caso%20de%20tr%C3%A2nsito." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="lawfarm-btn-wpp btn-large-lawfarm">
            <span>Chamar no WhatsApp</span>
            <span class="arrow-circle">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Mobile Floating Wpp Bar -->
<div class="mobile-float-wpp">
  <div class="float-info">
    <strong class="float-title">Dra. Marcela Santana</strong>
    <span class="float-subtitle">Direito de Trânsito</span>
  </div>

  <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=5534991692737&text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20Dra.%20Marcela!%20Gostaria%20de%20falar%20no%20WhatsApp." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="lawfarm-btn-wpp btn-compact">
    <span>Chamar no WhatsApp</span>
    <span class="arrow-circle">↗</span>
  </a>
</div>

<style>
  .lawfarm-cta-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-cream);
  }

  .cta-box-lawfarm {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, rgba(158, 111, 56, 0.08) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 4.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  }

  .cta-inner-content {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-lawfarm-title {
    font-family: var(--font-h1);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-navy);
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .cta-lawfarm-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .btn-large-lawfarm {
    padding: 1.1rem 2.4rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .btn-compact {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .btn-compact .arrow-circle {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .float-info .float-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-navy);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .float-info .float-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-bronze);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
